  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<color=#FFD24D>DEPLOY</color>

    Drag a card onto your half of the arena,
    or tap a card and then tap where it should go. The red area is off limits.


    <color=#FFD24D>ELIXIR</color>

    Every
    card costs elixir. It refills on its own, twice as fast in the last minute. Don''t
    sit at 10 - that''s wasted elixir.


    <color=#FFD24D>CROWNS</color>

    Each
    side tower you destroy is a crown. Take the king tower and you win instantly.
    Your king wakes up when it gets hit or loses a side tower.


    <color=#FFD24D>TIME</color>

    Most
    crowns after 2:00 wins. Tied? Overtime: the next crown wins. Still tied after
    that, it''s a draw.


    <color=#FFD24D>CROSSING</color>

    Troops can only
    cross the river at the two bridges. Once you take a side tower you can deploy
    deeper in that lane.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 617bd83521b90484dab4353cf90dde4b, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 6946272043152428540, guid: 617bd83521b90484dab4353cf90dde4b, type: 2}
